  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice Innovation in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For this project, we aim to focus on developing and growing justice entrepreneurs that could help to prevent or resolve the justice problems identified as most prevalent by our previous research and from the collaboration with the Legal Aid Forum Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HiiL conducted a Rule of Law Quick Scan in Rwanda in 2012 that employment, land and housing were the most common legal issues among people in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
